{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34453","headline":"送董少卿游茅山 · 陆龟蒙","name":"送董少卿游茅山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"威辇高悬度世名，至今仙裔作公卿。\n将随羽节朝珠阙，曾佩鱼符管赤城。\n云冻尚含孤石色，雪乾犹堕古松声。\n应知四扇灵方在，待取归时绿髪生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34453.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34453","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}